  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that three points lie on a plane,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0083_dc76fc6d9cc4.png\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 242px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>10</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>10</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Equation of plane will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>And the plane passing through,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Now finding the foot of perpendicular we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>38</mn><mn>38</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Distance from origin&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></msqrt></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>42</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
